      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 5.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Good evening, uh, doctor, thank you for staying late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.86,
      "end_seconds": 11.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.81,
      "end_seconds": 20.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a tight feeling in the chest. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.2,
      "end_seconds": 26.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.14,
      "end_seconds": 34.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Ever since... since Friday, really. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.93,
      "end_seconds": 41.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "How intense does it get?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.63,
      "end_seconds": 45.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "I, I'd call it mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.89,
      "end_seconds": 52.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "right. Okay, a few quick ones: thoughts of harming myself, fainting, alcohol use or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.0,
      "end_seconds": 55.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.82,
      "end_seconds": 60.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.26,
      "end_seconds": 64.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.64,
      "end_seconds": 71.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "So, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.75,
      "end_seconds": 83.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.64,
      "text": "I drive a delivery van all day. I share a flat with two friends. Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.86,
      "end_seconds": 104.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.48,
      "end_seconds": 108.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "no, I've never had anything serious"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.05,
      "end_seconds": 118.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.48,
      "end_seconds": 121.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.34,
      "end_seconds": 126.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.88,
      "end_seconds": 133.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "No, uh, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.62,
      "end_seconds": 150.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.52,
      "end_seconds": 153.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "no, nothing regular"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.44,
      "end_seconds": 157.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "a few measurements, then we'll continue"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.0,
      "end_seconds": 167.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "One second..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.98,
      "end_seconds": 187.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 122 over 80, respiratory rate 15, temp 36.5 degrees, pulse is 74 beats a a minute, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.52,
      "end_seconds": 193.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.77,
      "end_seconds": 198.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I'll explain what that that means shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.97,
      "end_seconds": 203.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Okay, shall we do the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.12,
      "end_seconds": 206.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.12,
      "end_seconds": 209.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "I'll go gently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.31,
      "end_seconds": 222.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "pulse is regular and you're breathing comfortably right now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.11,
      "end_seconds": 224.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.55,
      "end_seconds": 235.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "That's all I need, thank you. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I'd lean towards an anxiety disorder."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.34,
      "end_seconds": 240.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.49,
      "end_seconds": 251.71,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an anxiety disorder, and we'll know more once the an ECG is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.89,
      "end_seconds": 294.21,
      "duration_seconds": 34.32,
      "text": "let's get an ECG, for palpitations i'll request a thyroid test, it'll help with anxiety you'll be taking escitalopram, 5 milligrams, once a day, for two weeks then review that should help with anxiety slow breathing, in for four and out for six, for a few minutes whenever it builds up regular exercise and less caffeine make a real difference if you have thoughts of harming yourself, that's the point to come in urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.75,
      "end_seconds": 297.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Okay, I'll remember."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.09,
      "end_seconds": 301.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "we'll catch up in two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.25,
      "end_seconds": 303.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.98,
      "end_seconds": 309.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "call the clinic if you need us"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.03,
      "end_seconds": 319.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
